  "description": "Mushroom-shaped canopies top the towers of Thrill Trail, finished in Crazy Pink and Sand Beige. Bridges link the towers, a rock wall gives children a harder way up and the slides bring everyone down. A swing set is attached to the structure, so swinging happens alongside climbing and hanging. Key users are 3 to 12 years, with the age group starting at 3. It covers 45'9\" x 33'8\" and needs a safe play area of 50'9\" x 39'8\", and the listed capacity is 15. The softer colours suit a resort lawn or a residential project that wants something other than the usual red and blue. The 3-year warranty applies to the galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope used in Thrill Trail. Ask us for a layout.",
